# SHUTTERBUG: the photo's frame is centred a third of the screen ahead of
# the ship (107 pixels), 64 wide and 52 tall: a foe right beside the ship
# isn't in it, one 30 pixels above or below the cursor is.
game shutterbug
cheat run 1
cheat quiet
cheat stop
cheat clear
cheat pos 60 84
cheat dummy 6 100 84 0
cheat dummy 6 167 112 0
cheat dummy 6 167 56 0
cheat dummy 6 250 84 0
press A
expect stunned == 2
